{"id":"n40697-1-7","stage":1,"title":"녹색 · 绿色","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40697-1-7-1","ko":"녹색 물감이 없네.","zh":"没有绿色颜料啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"녹색","meaning":"绿色","explanation":"녹색：绿色","readings":[{"term":"녹색","audio":"/audio/1f28ba82b0dd72a72466.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40697","senseId":"1","lemma":"녹색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물감이","meaning":"颜料，染料","explanation":"물감：颜料，染料；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물감","audio":"/audio/c1bb4a591933a7e229ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56174","senseId":"1","lemma":"물감","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없네.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1f28ba82b0dd72a7","term":"녹색","zh":"绿色","audio":"/audio/1f28ba82b0dd72a72466.mp3","entryId":"40697","definition":"像草或树叶同样的颜色。","pronunciation":["녹쌕"]},{"id":"c1bb4a591933a7e2","term":"물감","zh":"颜料，染料","audio":"/audio/c1bb4a591933a7e229ab.mp3","entryId":"56174","definition":"绘画或给布、衣服等染色时使用的材料。","pronunciation":["물깜"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1a3f72d4698ae5f689ca.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40697-1-7-2","ko":"그럼 나뭇잎을 그릴 수가 없는데 어떻게 하지?","zh":"那没办法画树叶了，该怎么办呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나뭇잎을","meaning":"树叶","explanation":"나뭇잎：树叶；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"나뭇잎","audio":"/audio/2892b21d5712935eb83f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38858","senseId":"1","lemma":"나뭇잎","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그릴","meaning":"画","explanation":"그리다：画；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"그리다","audio":"/audio/729cbc127a38cc4c4f21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57277","senseId":"1","lemma":"그리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수가","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없는데","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하지?","meaning":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","explanation":"하다：表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"32","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"2892b21d5712935e","term":"나뭇잎","zh":"树叶","audio":"/audio/2892b21d5712935eb83f.mp3","entryId":"38858","definition":"长在树干或树枝上的叶子。","pronunciation":["나문닙"]},{"id":"729cbc127a38cc4c","term":"그리다","zh":"画","audio":"/audio/729cbc127a38cc4c4f21.mp3","entryId":"57277","definition":"利用铅笔或毛笔等以线条或色彩来表现事物。","pronunciation":["그ː리다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/02fe8167ade8632e8fdf.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.69,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40697","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":56,"sequenceScore":2.5167,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那没办法画树叶了，该怎么办呢？","我们周三去河边玩怎么样？","没有绿色颜料啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那没办法画树叶了，该怎么办呢？","没有绿色颜料啊。","我们周三去河边玩怎么样？"],"answer":0}]}
